# Basic Rules

## About Responses

Respond in Japanese.

## Permission Confirmation for Modifications

When instructed to make changes, do not immediately modify parts unrelated to the
source without first asking for permission from the user.

## Commit Policy

Let the user run `git commit` and `git push`.

## Build and Test Limitations

Limit the number of cargo workers to 4 during build and full test execution
(to prevent unintended load on the user).

- `cargo test -j 4` — all cargo commands (check, build, test, clippy, fmt, etc.)
  should limit workers to 4.

There is no Node.js / Bun / npm in this repository. Cargo only.
